  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Africa Energy Transition - China</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to drive a just transition from coal and charcoal to renewable energy and clean cooking solutions in three African countries, by:
&#x2022; Addressing national policy and regulatory frameworks for energy
&#x2022; Accelerating regional cross-border trade in renewable energy on and off grid
&#x2022; Facilitating the divestment of African and Chinese financial institutions from coal fired power plants and increasing financial flows to renewable energy, including women-led renewable energy enterprise</narrative>
  </description>
